            "content": "<div class=\"space-y-3 text-gray-700\"><p class=\"font-semibold text-gray-900\">An SRIT graduate in Civil Engineering, after three to four years of graduation will:</p><p class=\"text-justify leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"text-[#f67437]\">PEO 1:</strong> Become successful professional in Government agencies/companies or become an entrepreneur.</p><p class=\"text-justify leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"text-[#f67437]\">PEO 2:</strong> Become responsible Civil Engineer with good leadership qualities to respond and contribute to the benefit of society at large.</p><p class=\"text-justify leading-relaxed\"><strong class=\"text-[#f67437]\">PEO 3:</strong> Engage in lifelong learning with good computational skills and work with multi-disciplinary approach and team spirit.</p></div>"
